{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
makemkv-tui uses the separately installed makemkvcon engine on PATH.
The multimedia/makemkv dependency has separate license and usage requirements
and may require FreeBSD Linux compatibility. This package bundles no engine.
Verify makemkvcon --help before extraction. Source track selection is read-only.
Batch plans default to $XDG_STATE_HOME/makemkv-tui/batches/ or
$HOME/.local/state/makemkv-tui/batches/. Preserve plans and staged MKVs on errors.
EOM
}
]
